        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: George Kuchar, Arthur Penn\n- Works: We, the Normal\n- Roles: film director, video artist, director, producer\n\nFacts:\n- Arthur Penn was born on September 27, 1922, and he was an American director and producer of film, television, and theater.\n- George Kuchar was born on August 31, 1942, and he was an American underground film director and video artist known for his low-fi aesthetic.\n- We, the Normal is a 1987 video by American video artist George Kuchar.\n- Arthur Penn died on September 28, 2010.\n- George Kuchar died on September 6, 2011.",
